body:
&nbsp;
Netanya,&nbsp;
Thank you for applying for the Research Analyst at Veolia North America.
Your application is currently being carefully reviewed by our hiring team. If your skills and experience align with this opportunity, a member of our talent team will reach out to discuss next steps.
In the meantime, feel free to learn more about Veolia North America by visiting our website.&nbsp;
&nbsp;
What&rsquo;s the Recruiting Process Like at Veolia North America?
1. Application
Explore our current job openings on the Veolia North America careers page. Once you find a role that interests you, apply directly through our website. Our Talent Acquisition team will then review your application.
&nbsp;
2. Interviews
If your application meets the role&rsquo;s requirements, our Talent Acquisition team will contact you to schedule an initial interview. This will be followed by an interview with the hiring manager, either in person or virtually.
Interviews are a great opportunity to ask questions about the role and company, as well as showcase your skills and enthusiasm for the position.
&nbsp;
3. Decision
If your application is not selected: You will receive an email notification. We encourage you to join our Talent Network to stay updated on future opportunities.
If your application is selected: Our Talent Acquisition team will reach out to extend a job offer and guide you through the next steps.
&nbsp;
Best regards,
Veolia North America&rsquo;s Talent Acquisition Team

Access My Application: https://jobs.smartrecruiters.com/my-applications/VeoliaEnvironnementSA/763ee3d8-4ec8-4a6b-a787-90cc96b15486?dcr_ci=VeoliaEnvironnementSA

