 Hi Netanya,
Thank you for taking the time to apply for the Analytics Engineer position at NBCUniversal.&nbsp;We wanted to inform you that at this time&nbsp;we will not be moving forward with your candidacy.  &nbsp;
We&nbsp;encourage you to continue to check out nbcunicareers.com and apply for jobs that match your skills and interests.   &nbsp;
Thanks again for your time, we truly value your interest in NBCUniversal. &nbsp;

Dear​​​​​​​Thank you for your interest in joining AmeriHealth Caritas and taking the time to apply for the 44598&nbsp;Operations Reporting Analyst&nbsp;role.We received a significant number of applications from qualified candidates, making this selection process extremely difficult. After careful consideration, we have decided to move forward with another candidate for this position.This correspondence applies to the position 44598&nbsp;Operations Reporting Analyst. &nbsp;If you have applied to multiple positions, you will receive a separate communication regarding your status on those opportunities.&nbsp;We hope you will stay connected with us. If you haven’t already, we encourage you to join our Talent Community to receive updates on new opportunities that may be a great fit for your skills and experience.<td align="center" style='margin:0px; background-color:
