Dear Netanya,&nbsp;&nbsp;
Thank you for taking the time to apply for this position at AbbVie. We appreciate your interest in exploring a career with us.&nbsp;&nbsp;
After careful consideration we have made the difficult decision to move forward with other candidates whose skills and experience more closely align to the requirements of the position.&nbsp;&nbsp;
We encourage you to continue browsing our career site for open, relevant roles and join our Talent Community if you&rsquo;re interested in learning more about future opportunities with AbbVie.&nbsp;&nbsp;
Thank you once again for your interest in pursuing opportunities with AbbVie.&nbsp;&nbsp;
&nbsp;
Sincerely,
AbbVie Talent Acquisition&nbsp;&nbsp;

